        "to_bros": "This horse has RUINED my concentration. Do you know what concentration COSTS?",
        "demand": "I require €500 for... therapeutic vocal rest. The trauma.",
        "negotiated": "...€200. Final. And you will write an apology letter.",
        "payment_received": "Hmph. See that it does not happen again. Not that it COULD."
      },
      
